{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56109","headline":"步虚词 二 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嵯峨玄都山，十方宗皇一。\n迢迢於宝台，光明焰流日。\n炜烨玉林华，蒨璨耀朱实。\n常念餐元精，链液固形质。\n金光散紫微，窈窕大乘逸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}